   "text": "1. Hallucinates: makes up a plausible answer\n2. Knowledge cutoff: nothing after training\n3. No private data: your PDFs, wiki, DB\n4. Not updated: policy changed last month?\n5. No sources: you can't check the answer",
   "originalText": "1. Hallucinates: makes up a plausible answer\n2. Knowledge cutoff: nothing after training\n3. No private data: your PDFs, wiki, DB\n4. Not updated: policy changed last month?\n5. No sources: you can't check the answer",
