   "text": "Long context\npaste the whole PDF every time\n\n+ fine for 1 small document\n- 1,000s of pages don't fit\n- you pay for every page, every question",
   "originalText": "Long context\npaste the whole PDF every time\n\n+ fine for 1 small document\n- 1,000s of pages don't fit\n- you pay for every page, every question",
